cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ZizkaDB in research or a publication, please cite it as below."
title: "ZizkaDB: an open-source database for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  ZizkaDB records every AI agent action as an event linked to the event that
  caused it. It explains decisions (why), replays what an agent knew at any
  past time (at), serves ranked memory for the next run, and keeps a
  per-agent hash chain so the history can be verified as unchanged.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Zizka AI"
    website: "https://zizka.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZIZKA-AI-SL/ZizkaDB"
url: "https://db.zizka.ai"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: "0.5.0"
keywords:
